<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">TransTeira</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>The disk holding the files of TransTeira is <strong>{{usage_percent}}</strong> full, above the alert threshold of {{threshold_percent}}.</p>
<p>Space used: {{used_size}} out of {{total_size}}.</p>
<p>When the disk is full, new deposits fail for every entity. Free some space or enlarge the disk, and check the storage quotas of the entities. This alert is sent once; it is raised again only after the usage has fallen 5 points below the threshold.</p>
<p><a href="{{admin_link}}" style="padding:12px 20px;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px;">Open the administration</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{admin_link}}</span></p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">This message was sent automatically by TransTeira. Please do not reply to it.</p>
